{"id":78,"name":"النبإ","transliteration":"An-Naba","translation_fr":"La nouvelle","translation_en":"The Tidings","type":"meccan","total_verses":40,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Sur quoi s'interrogent-ils mutuellement","translation_en":"About what are they asking one another","transliteration":"AAamma yatasaaloona"},{"id":2,"text":"عَنِ ٱلنَّبَإِ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","translation_fr":"Sur la grande nouvelle","translation_en":"About the great news","transliteration":"AAani alnnabai alAAatheemi"},{"id":3,"text":"ٱلَّذِي هُمۡ فِيهِ مُخۡتَلِفُونَ","translation_fr":"à propos de laquelle ils divergent","translation_en":"That over which they are in disagreement","transliteration":"Allathee hum feehi mukhtalifoona"},{"id":4,"text":"كَلَّا سَيَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Eh bien non! Ils sauront bientôt","translation_en":"No! They are going to know","transliteration":"Kalla sayaAAlamoona"},{"id":5,"text":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَيَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Encore une fois, non! Ils sauront bientôt","translation_en":"Then, no! They are going to know","transliteration":"Thumma kalla sayaAAlamoona"},{"id":6,"text":"أَلَمۡ نَجۡعَلِ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ مِهَٰدٗا","translation_fr":"N'avons-Nous pas fait de la terre une couche","translation_en":"Have We not made the earth a resting place","transliteration":"Alam najAAali alarda mihadan"},{"id":7,"text":"وَٱلۡجِبَالَ أَوۡتَادٗا","translation_fr":"et (placé) les montagnes comme des piquets","translation_en":"And the mountains as stakes","transliteration":"Waaljibala awtadan"},{"id":8,"text":"وَخَلَقۡنَٰكُمۡ أَزۡوَٰجٗا","translation_fr":"Nous vous avons créés en couples","translation_en":"And We created you in pairs","transliteration":"Wakhalaqnakum azwajan"},{"id":9,"text":"وَجَعَلۡنَا نَوۡمَكُمۡ سُبَاتٗا","translation_fr":"et désigné votre sommeil pour votre repos","translation_en":"And made your sleep [a means for] rest","transliteration":"WajaAAalna nawmakum subatan"},{"id":10,"text":"وَجَعَلۡنَا ٱلَّيۡلَ لِبَاسٗا","translation_fr":"et fait de la nuit un vêtement","translation_en":"And made the night as clothing","transliteration":"WajaAAalna allayla libasan"},{"id":11,"text":"وَجَعَلۡنَا ٱلنَّهَارَ مَعَاشٗا","translation_fr":"et assigné le jour pour les affaires de la vie","translation_en":"And made the day for livelihood","transliteration":"WajaAAalna alnnahara maAAashan"},{"id":12,"text":"وَبَنَيۡنَا فَوۡقَكُمۡ سَبۡعٗا شِدَادٗا","translation_fr":"et construit au-dessus de vous sept (cieux) renforcés","translation_en":"And constructed above you seven strong [heavens]","transliteration":"Wabanayna fawqakum sabAAan shidadan"},{"id":13,"text":"وَجَعَلۡنَا سِرَاجٗا وَهَّاجٗا","translation_fr":"et [y] avons placé une lampe (le soleil) très ardente","translation_en":"And made [therein] a burning lamp","transliteration":"WajaAAalna sirajan wahhajan"},{"id":14,"text":"وَأَنزَلۡنَا مِنَ ٱلۡمُعۡصِرَٰتِ مَآءٗ ثَجَّاجٗا","translation_fr":"et fait descendre des nuées une eau abondante","translation_en":"And sent down, from the rain clouds, pouring water","transliteration":"Waanzalna mina almuAAsirati maan thajjajan"},{"id":15,"text":"لِّنُخۡرِجَ بِهِۦ حَبّٗا وَنَبَاتٗا","translation_fr":"pour faire pousser par elle grains et plantes","translation_en":"That We may bring forth thereby grain and vegetation","transliteration":"Linukhrija bihi habban wanabatan"},{"id":16,"text":"وَجَنَّـٰتٍ أَلۡفَافًا","translation_fr":"et jardins luxuriants","translation_en":"And gardens of entwined growth","transliteration":"Wajannatin alfafan"},{"id":17,"text":"إِنَّ يَوۡمَ ٱلۡفَصۡلِ كَانَ مِيقَٰتٗا","translation_fr":"Le Jour de la Décision [du Jugement] a son terme fixé","translation_en":"Indeed, the Day of Judgement is an appointed time","transliteration":"Inna yawma alfasli kana meeqatan"},{"id":18,"text":"يَوۡمَ يُنفَخُ فِي ٱلصُّورِ فَتَأۡتُونَ أَفۡوَاجٗا","translation_fr":"Le jour où l'on soufflera dans la Trompe, vous viendrez par troupes","translation_en":"The Day the Horn is blown and you will come forth in multitudes","transliteration":"Yawma yunfakhu fee alssoori fatatoona afwajan"},{"id":19,"text":"وَفُتِحَتِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ فَكَانَتۡ أَبۡوَٰبٗا","translation_fr":"et le ciel sera ouvert et [présentera] des portes","translation_en":"And the heaven is opened and will become gateways","transliteration":"Wafutihati alssamao fakanat abwaban"},{"id":20,"text":"وَسُيِّرَتِ ٱلۡجِبَالُ فَكَانَتۡ سَرَابًا","translation_fr":"et les montagnes seront mises en marche et deviendront un mirage","translation_en":"And the mountains are removed and will be [but] a mirage","transliteration":"Wasuyyirati aljibalu fakanat saraban"},{"id":21,"text":"إِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ كَانَتۡ مِرۡصَادٗا","translation_fr":"L'Enfer demeure aux aguets","translation_en":"Indeed, Hell has been lying in wait","transliteration":"Inna jahannama kanat mirsadan"},{"id":22,"text":"لِّلطَّـٰغِينَ مَـَٔابٗا","translation_fr":"refuge pour les transgresseurs","translation_en":"For the transgressors, a place of return","transliteration":"Lilttagheena maaban"},{"id":23,"text":"لَّـٰبِثِينَ فِيهَآ أَحۡقَابٗا","translation_fr":"Ils y demeureront pendant des siècles successifs","translation_en":"In which they will remain for ages [unending]","transliteration":"Labitheena feeha ahqaban"},{"id":24,"text":"لَّا يَذُوقُونَ فِيهَا بَرۡدٗا وَلَا شَرَابًا","translation_fr":"Ils n'y goûteront ni fraîcheur ni breuvage","translation_en":"They will not taste therein [any] coolness or drink","transliteration":"La yathooqoona feeha bardan wala sharaban"},{"id":25,"text":"إِلَّا حَمِيمٗا وَغَسَّاقٗا","translation_fr":"Hormis une eau bouillante et un pus","translation_en":"Except scalding water and [foul] purulence","transliteration":"Illa hameeman waghassaqan"},{"id":26,"text":"جَزَآءٗ وِفَاقًا","translation_fr":"comme rétribution équitable","translation_en":"An appropriate recompense","transliteration":"Jazaan wifaqan"},{"id":27,"text":"إِنَّهُمۡ كَانُواْ لَا يَرۡجُونَ حِسَابٗا","translation_fr":"Car ils ne s'attendaient pas à rendre compte","translation_en":"Indeed, they were not expecting an account","transliteration":"Innahum kanoo la yarjoona hisaban"},{"id":28,"text":"وَكَذَّبُواْ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا كِذَّابٗا","translation_fr":"et traitaient de mensonges, continuellement, Nos versets","translation_en":"And denied Our verses with [emphatic] denial","transliteration":"Wakaththaboo biayatina kiththaban"},{"id":29,"text":"وَكُلَّ شَيۡءٍ أَحۡصَيۡنَٰهُ كِتَٰبٗا","translation_fr":"alors que Nous avons dénombré toutes choses en écrit","translation_en":"But all things We have enumerated in writing","transliteration":"Wakulla shayin ahsaynahu kitaban"},{"id":30,"text":"فَذُوقُواْ فَلَن نَّزِيدَكُمۡ إِلَّا عَذَابًا","translation_fr":"Goûtez-donc. Nous n'augmenterons pour vous que le châtiment","translation_en":"So taste [the penalty], and never will We increase you except in torment","transliteration":"Fathooqoo falan nazeedakum illa AAathaban"},{"id":31,"text":"إِنَّ لِلۡمُتَّقِينَ مَفَازًا","translation_fr":"Pour les pieux ce sera une réussite","translation_en":"Indeed, for the righteous is attainment","transliteration":"Inna lilmuttaqeena mafazan"},{"id":32,"text":"حَدَآئِقَ وَأَعۡنَٰبٗا","translation_fr":"jardins et vignes","translation_en":"Gardens and grapevines","transliteration":"Hadaiqa waaAAnaban"},{"id":33,"text":"وَكَوَاعِبَ أَتۡرَابٗا","translation_fr":"et des (belles) aux seins arrondis, d'une égale jeunesse","translation_en":"And full-breasted [companions] of equal age","transliteration":"WakawaAAiba atraban"},{"id":34,"text":"وَكَأۡسٗا دِهَاقٗا","translation_fr":"et coupes débordantes","translation_en":"And a full cup","transliteration":"Wakasan dihaqan"},{"id":35,"text":"لَّا يَسۡمَعُونَ فِيهَا لَغۡوٗا وَلَا كِذَّـٰبٗا","translation_fr":"Ils n'y entendront ni futilités ni mensonges","translation_en":"No ill speech will they hear therein or any falsehood","transliteration":"La yasmaAAoona feeha laghwan wala kiththaban"},{"id":36,"text":"جَزَآءٗ مِّن رَّبِّكَ عَطَآءً حِسَابٗا","translation_fr":"A titre de récompense de ton Seigneur et à titre de don abondant","translation_en":"[As] reward from your Lord, [a generous] gift [made due by] account","transliteration":"Jazaan min rabbika AAataan hisaban"},{"id":37,"text":"رَّبِّ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَا ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِۖ لَا يَمۡلِكُونَ مِنۡهُ خِطَابٗا","translation_fr":"du Seigneur des cieux et de la terre et de ce qui existe entre eux, le Tout Miséricordieux; ils n'osent nullement Lui adresser la parole","translation_en":"[From] the Lord of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them, the Most Merciful. They possess not from Him [authority for] speech","transliteration":"Rabbi alssamawati waalardi wama baynahuma alrrahmani la yamlikoona minhu khitaban"},{"id":38,"text":"يَوۡمَ يَقُومُ ٱلرُّوحُ وَٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ صَفّٗاۖ لَّا يَتَكَلَّمُونَ إِلَّا مَنۡ أَذِنَ لَهُ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ وَقَالَ صَوَابٗا","translation_fr":"Le jour où l'Esprit et les Anges se dresseront en rangs, nul ne saura parler, sauf celui à qui le Tout Miséricordieux aura accordé la permission, et qui dira la vérité","translation_en":"The Day that the Spirit and the angels will stand in rows, they will not speak except for one whom the Most Merciful permits, and he will say what is correct","transliteration":"Yawma yaqoomu alrroohu waalmalaikatu saffan la yatakallamoona illa man athina lahu alrrahmanu waqala sawaban"},{"id":39,"text":"ذَٰلِكَ ٱلۡيَوۡمُ ٱلۡحَقُّۖ فَمَن شَآءَ ٱتَّخَذَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِۦ مَـَٔابًا","translation_fr":"Ce jour-là est inéluctable. Que celui qui veut prenne donc refuge auprès de son Seigneur","translation_en":"That is the True Day; so he who wills may take to his Lord a [way of] return","transliteration":"Thalika alyawmu alhaqqu faman shaa ittakhatha ila rabbihi maaban"},{"id":40,"text":"إِنَّآ أَنذَرۡنَٰكُمۡ عَذَابٗا قَرِيبٗا يَوۡمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلۡمَرۡءُ مَا قَدَّمَتۡ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلۡكَافِرُ يَٰلَيۡتَنِي كُنتُ تُرَٰبَۢا","translation_fr":"Nous vous avons avertis d'un châtiment bien proche, le jour où l'homme verra ce que ses deux mains ont préparé; et l'infidèle dira: «Hélas pour moi! Comme j'aurais aimé n'être que poussière»","translation_en":"Indeed, We have warned you of a near punishment on the Day when a man will observe what his hands have put forth and the disbeliever will say, \"Oh, I wish that I were dust","transliteration":"Inna antharnakum AAathaban qareeban yawma yanthuru almaro ma qaddamat yadahu wayaqoolu alkafiru ya laytanee kuntu turaban"}]}